Source: vala-panel-appmenu
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: jpablo <jpablolassala@gmail.com>
XSBC-Original-Maintainer: Ayatana Packagers <pkg-ayatana-devel@lists.alioth.debian.org>
# Ubuntu 26.04's vala-panel-appmenu 25.04+dfsg-3ubuntu1, at upstream's 25.04 tag with
# Caminito's carried patches (ADR 0029), cut down as Arch's vala-panel-appmenu-mate-caminito
# is: the MATE applet alone, on libwnck, with the menu translator linked into it. These are
# the differences from Ubuntu's:
# - No Xfce, Vala Panel or Budgie plugin. So there is no libvalapanel-dev,
#   libxfce4panel-2.0-dev, libxfce4ui-2-dev or libxfconf-0-dev.
# - libmate-panel-applet-dev is at mate-panel's caminito version. The panel loads the applet
#   into its own process, so the applet must link libmate-panel-applet-4.so.2 (196), not
#   Ubuntu's .so.1.
# Ubuntu's /etc/profile.d/vala-panel-appmenu.sh stays in vala-panel-appmenu-common. It adds
# appmenu-gtk-module to GTK_MODULES in every session, as the stock package does. Arch's
# package doesn't have it.
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
               gobject-introspection,
               meson (>= 0.51.0),
               libglib2.0-dev,
               libgtk-3-dev,
               libmate-panel-applet-dev (>= 1.29.0~),
               libwnck-3-dev,
               valac,
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://gitlab.com/vala-panel-project/vala-panel-appmenu
Vcs-Git: https://salsa.debian.org/debian-ayatana-team/vala-panel-appmenu.git
Vcs-Browser: https://salsa.debian.org/debian-ayatana-team/vala-panel-appmenu

Package: mate-applet-appmenu
Architecture: any
Depends: vala-panel-appmenu-common (>= ${source:Version}),
         appmenu-registrar,
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
Recommends: libdbusmenu-glib4,
            libdbusmenu-gtk3-4,
            appmenu-gtk3-module,
Description: Application Menu plugin for mate-panel
 This is an Application Menu (Global Menu) plugin. It is built using
 the Unity protocol and libraries and provides all features found in
 the Unity implementation.
 .
 This package provides the plugin for MATE.

Package: vala-panel-appmenu-common
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
Description: Common files for Application Menu plugins
 This is an Application Menu (Global Menu) plugin. It is built using
 the Unity protocol and libraries and provides all features found in
 the Unity implementation.
 .
 This package provides common files.
